# UI Consistency

- Reuse shared UI components from `components/ui` across all pages.
- Keep style tokens centralized in `app/globals.css`.
- Do not create one-off button/input/card/modal variants in pages.
- Use the same spacing scale and typography patterns app-wide.
- Keep interactions and states consistent (hover, focus, disabled, errors).
